  {
    "reviewId": 8768168,
    "trailId": 10571725,
    "comment": "Trail itself is good/ok. I went on a Saturday and it was busy, including group of people playing music from Bluetooth speaker so I wouldn’t recommend going on the weekend. \nSherman Falls area PACKED with people. If you’re going to do some photography, avoid weekends. \nTiffany falls are nice and not crowded as area is technically closed (not sure why...) \nLots of shade so does not get too hot, noise from the highway is bit odd. Go if you like busy trails; don’t go or go during the week if you’re looking to find some peace. \n ",
